{
 "chunk": 28,
 "cat": "jar",
 "items": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "\"Welcome! I've got something here that I think you'll find very interesting. Your actions over the past several cycles have caused quite a stir in certain corners, and I took it upon myself to look into your history, as it were. Here, let me transfer the synopsis.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "\"Welcome, welcome, please sit! I'm sure you're wondering why I called you over.\"\n\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "'s face for just a moment before ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "... something interesting, but not of immediate import",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "A weary expression passes over the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "An old ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "End the conversation",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "Go over to the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "I think we can help each other, you and I. See, I have the information,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "The historian tells you about...",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "You spend a couple minutes sharing drinks and conversing about recent goings-on in the Sector. Before long you get down to business.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "You thank ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "en": "Your TriPad chimes softly; a new program is ready to be installed.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "en": "know for sure where I'll end up in a couple of months.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "en": "leafing through what looks like a genuine hardcopy paper book. As you walk by, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "en": "Ship Blueprint",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/ShipBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "en": " - Recovered",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/SpecialItemOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
