   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "en": "However, the base supporting these cells is no longer operational. It is projected that establishing a new support network will take at least %s ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "en": "If the base is destroyed, it will take some time to organize support from another base, and both ground and fleet operations will be disrupted.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "en": "If they succeed, the colony will effectively be destroyed.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "en": "Incident averted by local security forces",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "en": "Luddic Path Cells",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "en": "Multiple planned attacks against various industrial, military, and civilian targets  were averted by the local security forces.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "en": "No impact on operations due to lack of material support.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "en": "No perceptible impact on operations as of yet.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "en": "Pather interest",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "en": "Stability reduced by %s",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
