   "en": "Suspected AI core administrator (%s)",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "en": "The Pather base at the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "en": "The Pather cells ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "en": "The Pather cells have conducted a successful act of sabotage, disrupting ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "en": "The Pather cells have conducted low-level attacks on various industrial, military, and civilian targets, reducing stability by %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "en": "The Pather cells have smuggled a planetbuster onto ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "en": "The Pathers have not made any significant moves, but are apparently preparing to do so if whatever activity they object to - industrial development, or the suspected use of AI cores, and other such - continues.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "en": "The following activity is attracting Pather interest, whether due to AI core use or the inherent nature of the industry:",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "en": "There are active Luddic Path cells ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "en": "There are indications that sleeper Luddic Path cells are being organized ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "en": "There are indications that the Pather cells are preparing to sneak a planetbuster onto ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "en": "They are engaged in planning acts of terror and industrial sabotage, but are unlikely to carry them off unless the overal level of hostile activity in the system provides sufficient cover. The cells also provide intel to Pather fleets operating in-system.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bases/LuddicPathCellsIntel.class"
  },
